{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celestial Lumina is a <strong>2D Pixel Art Metroidvania</strong> exploring the themes of <strong>Light</strong> <strong>vs</strong> <strong>Darkness</strong> &amp; <strong>Heaven</strong> <strong>vs</strong> <strong>Earth</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WHAT TO EXPECT:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, Rebindable Controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ Distinct Areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Narratives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thoughtful Level Design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ Custom Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fierce, Souls-Like Combat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout his journey, Evan, son of the Great Underworld Castle's King Frederick, will discover the truth concerning the Star and how dawn never comes to this world. Dark entities will hunt you down, forcing you to run until you are fully capable of taking them down. Who is puppeting the Darkness in the world and will it ever see the light again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the vast lands scaling up from a small Fernlight Grove to the mountainous Starlit Peaks. Explore the technological ruins of the old sky city of Aetheros, city of Light, all while traveling through its lovely Hanging Gardens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/extras/2d9acde191994be1e9f03924e79094b0.avif?t=1756343525\" width=1560 height=678 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/extras/7d7c0c9454004d612e99213d4af92ce3.avif?t=1756343525\" width=1560 height=675 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Celestial Lumina to unravel the mysteries of the dense dark world and restore its light!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963060?t=1756343525","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963060?t=1756343525","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/426ffb7998eb5a6f107a99964b2dddb560150ad6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756343525","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/426ffb7998eb5a6f107a99964b2dddb560150ad6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756343525","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celestial Lumina is a <strong>2D Pixel Art Metroidvania</strong> exploring the themes of <strong>Light</strong> <strong>vs</strong> <strong>Darkness</strong> &amp; <strong>Heaven</strong> <strong>vs</strong> <strong>Earth</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WHAT TO EXPECT:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, Rebindable Controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ Distinct Areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Narratives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thoughtful Level Design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ Custom Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fierce, Souls-Like Combat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout his journey, Evan, son of the Great Underworld Castle's King Frederick, will discover the truth concerning the Star and how dawn never comes to this world. Dark entities will hunt you down, forcing you to run until you are fully capable of taking them down. Who is puppeting the Darkness in the world and will it ever see the light again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_para